WEBVTT

00:13:28.667 --> 00:13:34.375
composers like Beethoven could share the insights of a lifetime.

00:13:34.375 --> 00:13:36.835
A piece like Beethoven's Fifth

00:13:36.835 --> 00:13:41.193
basically witnessing how it was possible

00:13:41.193 --> 00:13:46.710
for him to go from sorrow and anger,

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:50.417
over the course of a half an hour,

00:13:50.417 --> 00:13:54.208
step by exacting step of his route,

00:13:54.208 --> 00:13:58.548
to the moment when he could make it across to joy.

00:13:58.548 --> 00:14:21.042
(Music)